OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine and then dry
OL,7,Fovernight with prolonged clear
OL,8,Fperiods. Patchy low cloud and mist may
OL,9,Fform over the Moors later. Staying
OL,10,Frather warm in some urban areas but
OL,11,Fconsiderably cooler in the countryside
OL,12,Fby dawn.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FAnother primarily sunny day
OL,15,Fwith just some patchy cloud at times.
OL,16,FA brisker easterly breeze than on
OL,17,FMonday, giving a somewhat fresher feel
OL,18,Fon southern coasts. Very warm further
OL,19,Fnorth.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
