OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FHot
OL,6,For very hot on Wednesday and Thursday
OL,7,Fwith plenty of strong sunshine.
OL,8,FTurning a little fresher and cloudier
OL,9,Fon Friday with perhaps the odd shower,
OL,10,Fbut remaining warm.
